| Replay seq3 | Accept, expected 5, recovered 1 |
| seq5 | Accept, expected 7 |
| seq9 ohne Replay | Request, dann **Abandon** nach Timeout, expected 9 |
| seq5 (stale) | Duplikat, kein Accept |
| seq9 erneut | Accept, expected 10 |

**4 Accepts, 2 Gaps, 1 Recovered, 1 Abandoned, 1 Duplikat ÔÇö PASS.**

### Verifikation gesamt
